-# A rank as a mini entity card — the mockup's mini('gold', glyph)
-# (30-lists.js:15). Gold, because rank and currency are gold in this design
-# language (DECISIONS.md:22).
-#
-# The art itself is ranks/_art, so this chip and the group overview's rank card
-# cannot end up disagreeing about what a rank looks like.
%span.gh-card.gh-card--gold.gh-mc
  %span.gh-card-f
    %span.gh-card-i{ data: local_assigns[:inner_data] }
      = render 'ranks/art', rank: rank
